                            <comment id="16723057" author="rkondakov" created="Mon, 17 Dec 2018 15:07:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I wasn&apos;t able to reproduce this hang locally. May be this case is fixed in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9663&quot; title=&quot;MVCC: Data node failure can cause TX hanging.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-9663&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-9663&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. But this test is still unstable.&#160;The failures may&#160;be caused by the problem described in&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9949&quot; title=&quot;MVCC TX: Scan query can return wrong result on unstable topology&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-9949&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-9949&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
